<view class="page" data-b="B701"><dev-badge wx:if="{{settings.developerMode}}" code="B701" />
  <view class="title">设置</view>
  <view class="subtitle">让时间表适合你的作息和排课方式</view>
  <view class="card" data-b="B229"><dev-badge wx:if="{{settings.developerMode}}" code="B229" /><view class="row"><view><view class="section-title">时间块设置</view><view class="subtitle">显示时间、分格和一级／二级标签</view></view><text class="settings-link" data-z="Z229-1" bindtap="goTimeSettings">打开 ›</text></view></view>
  <view class="card" data-b="B705"><dev-badge wx:if="{{settings.developerMode}}" code="B705" />
    <view class="section-title">开发者模式</view>
    <view class="row switch-row"><view class="subtitle">查看并复制页面和控件编号</view><switch checked="{{settings.developerMode}}" color="#236e53" data-z="Z701-8" bindchange="toggleDeveloper" /></view>
    <view wx:if="{{settings.developerMode}}" class="code-panel" data-b="B702"><dev-badge code="B702" />
      <picker mode="selector" range="{{pageGroups}}" value="{{selectedGroup}}" data-z="Z702-1" bindchange="selectGroup"><view class="picker">{{pageGroups[selectedGroup]}}编号 ▾</view></picker>
      <view class="subtitle code-help">B 是界面，Z 是可沟通的操作。点编号即可复制。</view>
      <scroll-view scroll-y class="code-scroll"><view wx:for="{{codes}}" wx:key="code" class="code-row" data-code="{{item.code}}" data-z="Z702-2" bindtap="copyCode"><text class="code">{{item.code}}</text><text class="code-name">{{item.name}}</text><text class="copy">复制</text></view></scroll-view>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="version">时间售卖 {{version}} · 本地演示</view>
  <view class="subtitle storage-note">资料与安排目前只保存在本机，换设备不会自动同步。</view>
</view>
